{"id":"momentan","lemma":"momentan","pos":"adv","rank":1824,"glosses":["at the moment","currently","for the time being"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fd/De-at-momentan.ogg/De-at-momentan.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Momentan habe ich nicht genug Geld.","en":"I don't have enough money at the moment.","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"enough"},{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"Er ist momentan nicht hier.","en":"He isn't here now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394788","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Ich habe momentan nichts zu sagen.","en":"I have nothing to say right now.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]},{"text":"Ich habe momentan kein Geld bei mir.","en":"I have no money with me now.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"at / with"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Momentan ist das alles, was ich sagen kann.","en":"At the moment, it's all I can say.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695385","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"everything"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"}]}]}